מ ׳יֵין royal wine 1:7 ; מ ׳דְּבַר royal command 1:19 ; מ ׳הוֺד royal honour, majesty 1Chr 29:25 ; Dan 11:21 ; so perhaps also מ ׳הֶדֶר 11:20 see Bev; מ בְּבוֺד ׳עשֶׁר Est 1:4 ; מ ׳כֶּתֶר royal crown 1:11 ; 2:17 ; 6:8 ; מ ׳לְבוּשׁ royal apparel 6:8 ; 8:15 ; ׳מ ( לְבוּשׁ omitted) 5:1 ( queenly attire ). 2 reign: 40th year of reign of David 1Chr 26:31 compare 2Chr 3:2 ; 15:10 , 19 ; 16:1 , 12 ; 35:19 ; Jer 49:34 ; Dan 1:1 ; also 2Chr 29:19 ; of Babylonian and Persian kings Jer 52:31 ( מ ׳בִּשְׁנַת || 2Kin 25:27 מָלְכוֺ ) Dan 2:1 ; 8:1 ; Ezra 4:5-6 , (twice in verse); 7:1 ; 8:1 ; Neh 12:22 ; Est 2:16 ; compare מָּרָס מַלְכוּת עַדמְֿלֹח 2Chr 36:20 . 3 kingdom, realm 2Chr 1:1 ; 11:17 ; 20:30 ; Neh 9:35 ; especially realm of Babylonia and Persia 2Chr 36:22 = Ezra 1:1 ; Est 1:14 , 20 ; 2:3 ; 3:6 , 8 ; 5:3 , 6 ; 7:2 ; 9:30 ; Dan 8:22 ; 9:1 ; 10:13 ; compare 11:2 , 4 (twice in verse); 11:9 , 17 ; 11:20 מ ׳הֶדֶר = Jerusalem according to Hi., but see 1 above","rootNote":"or מַלְכֻת ; or (in plural) מַלְכֻיָּה ; from 4427 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 10","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 10","1Chr 12 24","1Chr 14 2","1Chr 17 11","1Chr 17 14","1Chr 22 10","1Chr 26 31","1Chr 28 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":91,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְ/מַלְכוּת֛/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַלְכ֥וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 14 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַלְכוּת֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַלְכוּתֽ/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 14","book":"1Chr","chapte